yCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7410285033,"name":"The Zombie's Revenge v26.4.1","desc":"We're working with Roblox to undo the 16+ Age limit.\n\nThe Rogothian Empire stands on the edge of collapse. The Deluge has begun. Cities drown, enemies gather, and only those willing to rise from nothing will carve their place in history.\n\nThe hubris of the Dedsfang Dominion has gone unpunished for much too long. \nThis war will decide everything.\nAnd when it ends… perhaps there will finally be peace.\n\n•⚔️Earn every weapon, every piece of armor, every upgrade, nothing is handed to you. You must prove your worth to the Empire, through badges and story completions.\n•📜Fight through the Deluge campaign, face off an army by yourself or hold the line alongside your comrades.\n•🦿Push beyond human limits with experimental cybernetic augmentations never meant for the average soldier.. Become powerful enough to claim the mettle of a legendary HERO yourself!!\n\n🏅The Empire rewards those who endure:\n\n+50% XP & Tokens on weekends\nPremium: -5% XP Requirement.","path":"/game/7410285033-the-zombie-s-revenge","slug":"7410285033-the-zombie-s-revenge","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a65b9389b32ee88c5c04ea73854fbd8331c5a26a52a2a0529675c75c172869dd.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-08c27926602a89495d5bbaf8c5c68eeb/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":3188427,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-05T03:04:05.664Z","creator":{"name":"31 Gaming","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8528736393,"name":"Beatland","desc":"Welcome to \"Beatland\" by Telekom Electronic Beats, a safe space for diverse communities to experience music culture. \n\n🌱 New Game: Floating Forest! Embark on an exciting journey – the Obby Jetpack trail with new Islands unlocked each week\n🎮 Acquire new free cosmetics! \n🕺 Dance and listen to new music\n🧑‍💼 Take jobs with your friends and earn Beatcoins to purchase free items! Complete the Obby in the tower or check out DJ HypeXta’s Mansion\n👜 Equip your Avatar with exclusive fashion, art, or accessories","path":"/game/8528736393-beatland","slug":"8528736393-beatland","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a62a595779a47ffa753fa7db3b313d7c24f4b5164bd7970b4cbb056bb9f356cd.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1df965131dba94a2a53bad6f01a538cc/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":22458813,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-06-14T23:29:41.236Z","creator":{"name":"Deutsche Telekom AG","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":8770868695,"name":"Anomalous Activities","desc":"MERCs are called upon to investigate Anomalous Fields, stabilise the area and neutralise the Subject, a nearly invisible threat with a multitude of powers and the ability to transform into terrifying creatures.\n\nAnomalous Activities is a 1v12 Asymmetrical shooter with horror elements, a focus on satisfying gunplay, teamwork, impactful gameplay and a skill ceiling.\n\n\nShared controls are listed in the lobby, the rest is common sense.\n\n\nType \"gamemode/classic\" to enable True Classic gamemode in VIP servers if you are the owner.\nTrue Classic is a gamemode designed to emulate the original Hidden: Source as faithfully as possible.\nProgression is not saved if True Classic mode is enabled.\n\"setclass/support\" and \"setclass/assault\" to change classes in True Classic gamemode.\n\n\nVotekick can be performed by typing votekick/[USERNAME] in the chat.\nYou do not need to write the full username.\n\n\nThumbnails contributed by 31Boy13 and darknessglows3.","path":"/game/8770868695-anomalous-activities","slug":"8770868695-anomalous-activities","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0261a3b91e436647ee1f58a55df63c804116959747fa075583a3570add158ff2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9fff2e25530f47afe08cd3590efd0e46/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":4494176,"verified":false